1
00:00:01,309 --> 00:00:03,329
[lamizik]

2
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:19,705
Nouvo sware dan kafeterya,

3
00:00:15,480 --> 00:00:19,705
Brouyar epe fonn bann lakaz. [lamizik]

4
00:00:20,320 --> 00:00:26,200
Mo promne dan bann kartie kot ena bann souvenir

5
00:00:23,080 --> 00:00:26,200
fer mwa vinn fou.

6
00:00:26,400 --> 00:00:32,095
Kot dan printan bien so

7
00:00:29,040 --> 00:00:33,320
Liver kouver lam.

8
00:00:32,095 --> 00:00:36,760
[lamizik]

9
00:00:33,320 --> 00:00:38,645
Kot lavi finn anvole kouma enn fles pas bann dat, pas

10
00:00:36,760 --> 00:00:39,160
nou.

11
00:00:38,645 --> 00:00:43,080
[lamizik]

12
00:00:39,160 --> 00:00:45,520
Nou finn ramas bann papie, finn bliye kifer nou

13
00:00:43,080 --> 00:00:45,520
nou viv.

14
00:00:45,720 --> 00:00:52,200
Ek li ti touletan paret, [lamizik]

15
00:00:47,240 --> 00:00:52,200
ena ankor enn son C devan.

16
00:00:52,400 --> 00:00:54,560
[lamizik]

17
00:00:52,600 --> 00:00:58,520
Zis finn pret letan

18
00:00:54,560 --> 00:00:58,520
pa donn nanie.

19
00:00:59,240 --> 00:01:04,440
Ek enn kout [lamizik] tom lor mo leker

20
00:01:01,800 --> 00:01:08,960
glason fre.

21
00:01:04,440 --> 00:01:12,200
Nou aprann apresie [lamizik] kan nou perdi,

22
00:01:08,960 --> 00:01:14,670
kan lalimier kikenn tengn deryer laport.

23
00:01:12,200 --> 00:01:15,240
Nou fer enn sign apre bann trin ki pe ale, pe sey

24
00:01:14,670 --> 00:01:18,320
[lamizik]

25
00:01:15,240 --> 00:01:21,920
sipliy lepase pou enn repons.

26
00:01:18,320 --> 00:01:25,000
Nou aprann kontan kan fer fre, [lamizik]

27
00:01:21,920 --> 00:01:26,360
kan ena lasann dan to lapat, pa lasie. LOR,

28
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:30,000
si selman mo ti kone alavans, [lamizik]

29
00:01:26,360 --> 00:01:31,840
kouma sa enn transparan la pou fermal dan lam

30
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:34,320
tristes.

31
00:01:31,840 --> 00:01:37,840
Li pa finn dir, [lamizik] li pa finn anbrase, li pa finn gagn letan.

32
00:01:34,320 --> 00:01:41,120
Sa li enn motif eternel.

33
00:01:37,840 --> 00:01:43,545
Mo finn gard tou pou taler, mo leker pa pou lezot

34
00:01:41,120 --> 00:01:43,545
finn ouver. [lamizik]

35
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:46,520
Nou pe lager ar lonbraz,

36
00:01:46,111 --> 00:01:50,480
[lamizik]

37
00:01:46,520 --> 00:01:53,316
nou fatige lor bann bagatel vid.

38
00:01:50,480 --> 00:01:53,880
Ek ou pa trouve kouma sa glason-la pe desann

39
00:01:53,316 --> 00:01:56,960
[lamizik]

40
00:01:53,880 --> 00:01:59,211
lor nou zepol.

41
00:01:56,960 --> 00:02:01,800
Me boner pa dan briyans enn vitrinn,

42
00:01:59,211 --> 00:02:05,040
[lamizik] pa dan enn ta biye, me dan enn plas trankil

43
00:02:01,800 --> 00:02:06,880
laverite bann fami, dan zot lasaler parmi bann siklonn. Me

44
00:02:05,040 --> 00:02:09,920
nou zis apresie seki [lamizik] ete deza

45
00:02:06,880 --> 00:02:12,600
inposib pou retourne.

46
00:02:09,920 --> 00:02:15,760
Kontign mo long

47
00:02:12,600 --> 00:02:20,280
ek souvan [lamizik] se enn sime ki pena sans,

48
00:02:15,760 --> 00:02:23,480
nou aprann apresie kan nou perdi [lamizik],

49
00:02:20,280 --> 00:02:25,880
kan lalimier kikenn tengn deryer laport.

50
00:02:23,480 --> 00:02:29,520
Nou fer sign apre [lamizik] bann trin ki finn ale,

51
00:02:25,880 --> 00:02:33,160
pe rod sipliy lepase pou enn repons.

52
00:02:29,520 --> 00:02:35,000
Nou aprann kontan [lamizik] kan li finn refroidi,

53
00:02:33,160 --> 00:02:36,160
kan ena lasann dan palmie, [lamizik] ek pa

54
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:39,200
lasie. LOR,

55
00:02:36,160 --> 00:02:43,040
Si selman mo ti kone alavans kouma li ti pou plengne dan

56
00:02:39,200 --> 00:02:45,061
sa tristes transparan dan lam.

57
00:02:43,040 --> 00:02:45,480
Apel bann vie dimoun, anbras zot,

58
00:02:45,061 --> 00:02:49,000
[lamizik]

59
00:02:45,480 --> 00:02:49,000
pandan ki batman leker pe bate.

60
00:02:49,440 --> 00:02:54,231
Les bann doleans pase, mo pou sa zordi

61
00:02:52,400 --> 00:02:55,080
Mo priye.

62
00:02:54,231 --> 00:02:58,280
[lamizik]

63
00:02:55,080 --> 00:03:00,127
Parski tou bann sante ena enn lafin

64
00:02:58,280 --> 00:03:01,320
alafin, enn.

65
00:03:00,127 --> 00:03:04,680
[pe sante]

66
00:03:01,320 --> 00:03:06,022
Nou [lamizik] res dan memwar bann etap,

67
00:03:04,680 --> 00:03:07,280
nou asize bliye.

68
00:03:06,022 --> 00:03:11,760
[lamizik]

69
00:03:07,280 --> 00:03:13,720
Nou aprann apresie kan nou perdi,

70
00:03:11,760 --> 00:03:14,959
kan lamizik kikenn sorti deryer laport

71
00:03:13,720 --> 00:03:17,959
lalimier.

72
00:03:14,959 --> 00:03:20,959
Nou fer enn sign apre bann trin ki pe ale, pe sey

73
00:03:17,959 --> 00:03:22,360
sipliy lepase pou enn repons.

74
00:03:20,959 --> 00:03:25,800
Nou aprann kontan, [lamizik]

75
00:03:22,360 --> 00:03:28,080
kan li finn refroidi, kan ti ena lasann dan palmie ek

76
00:03:25,800 --> 00:03:31,160
kristal [lamizik] kase. Mo bizin okip li

77
00:03:28,080 --> 00:03:33,532
ki ete, pandan ki nou la, ziska

78
00:03:31,160 --> 00:03:33,560
finn anvole

79
00:03:33,532 --> 00:03:36,720
[lamizik]

80
00:03:33,560 --> 00:03:36,720
lam dan distans.

81
